---
source: crates/noc/src/tui/which_key.rs
expression: "draw(&hints, 100, 12)"
---
"╔═════════════════════════════════════════════ Ctrl+x ═════════════════════════════════════════════╗"
"║ j   The running jobs: bring one to the front, or abort it                                        ║"
"║ #   Checksums of the marked files, or the one under the cursor                                   ║"
"║ 1   Change the left panel's location: a volume or a host                                         ║"
"║ 2   Change the right panel's location: a volume or a host                                        ║"
"║ z   Jump to a directory that zoxide ranks, in this panel                                         ║"
"║ t   A new tab in this panel, on the same directory                                               ║"
"║ w   Close this tab; the last one stays                                                           ║"
"║ n   The next tab in this panel                                                                   ║"
"║ p   The previous tab in this panel                                                               ║"
"║ Tab The tabs of this panel, to choose one                                                        ║"
"╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ Esc closes, Backspace goes back ══╝"
